{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Av57HLDM571794820421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》13日首站由移居香港七年的越南人 Tracy 帶領，尋找最道地的越南國民美食。</p><p></p><p><strong>第一站：油麻地地道越南國民美食</strong></p><p>由移居香港七年的越南人 Tracy 帶領，尋找最道地的越南國民美食：</p><ul><li><p><strong>越式米紙蝦卷：</strong> 內裡包裹著爽脆的醃蘿蔔、鮮美海鮮、豐富香草與檬粉，並搭配獨特的越式蝦醬與花生醬，鹹甜交織且層次分明。</p></li><li><p><strong>蟹膏番茄湯檬：</strong> 湯底由越南中部直運新鮮食材，番茄的酸甜完美融入濃郁的海鮮高湯中，吸滿湯汁的檬粉猶如海綿般滋味無窮。手工製的蟹膏口感像凍豆腐般充滿氣孔，完全吸收了鮮甜的蟹肉與湯底精華，毫不腥氣。</p></li><li><p><strong>順化牛腱米線：</strong> 以長時間熬煮的清甜牛骨湯底，搭配厚切至極度軟嫩、入口即化的牛腱肉，再蘸上由香茅、辣椒粉、紅蔥頭炒製而成的特製越南辣椒醬，酸辣開胃。</p></li><li><p><strong>餐廳資料：</strong> 第一郡（油麻地彌敦道483-485A號2樓）</p></li></ul><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5fa4f6fc-b708-4ba9-b506-1e6c2f9755b7.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026CIKyt3NmEF1794820421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"87153a6d-1fc8-4630-bf7c-05bdd6bbfeee.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Kgpria7F6q1794820422.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"b783383d-b7c5-46a2-8e65-ad454d5b2f73.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026To1hd6NbnY1794820422.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"bf4483e5-d0e5-4346-a2a3-2fbcee07a679.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026EH8llv7ing1794820422.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>第二站：荃灣高層海景酒店奢華下午茶</strong></p><p>黃嘉雯與胡美儀前往荃灣一間高層海景酒店餐廳，享受愜意又免去排隊煩惱的奢華下午茶。餐廳不僅提供消費滿額即享三小時免費代客泊車的貼心服務，更與荃灣知名的人氣糯米糍老字號強勢聯乘，讓食客能在璀璨海景陪伴下一次過滿足所有願望。</p><ul><li><p><strong>香烤肉類拼盤：</strong> 下午茶打頭陣之作，極具份量，匯聚了迷你漢堡、多汁的慢火燒豬腩肉（配搭蜜糖燒肉汁與香脆炸蒜）、Tandoori 風格香辣惹味的羊架、牛肉串、雞肉串及燒菠蘿，種類豐富且肉汁豐盈。</p></li><li><p><strong>鴨肝西多士（鹹點）：</strong> 精緻茶套餐的亮點之一，將外脆內軟的小巧西多士結合甘香融化的鴨肝與花生醬，鹹甜交融滋味一流。</p></li><li><p><strong>芒果拿破崙（甜點）：</strong> 外皮酥脆，帶來芒果香甜爆發的驚喜口感。</p></li><li><p><strong>餐廳資料：</strong> Bar 41（荃灣楊屋道8號荃灣西如心酒店41樓）</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"b1015359-59b3-46be-83e3-e4e7caf7733a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20260rXii43Co11794820423.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"6c908c89-0d44-4f1f-a555-3b0ae2c4d8b2.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026ykHFIaeyDZ1794820423.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:07.999246+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":701,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T20:33:38.233562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:23:30.308758+00:00","content_hash":"4c02687f32c4abb97a46f31aed2a1b7ff85eaff144a2e260cc94c0d8d6d8d8f5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:07.999246+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}